{"title":"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/2/6d2bc8cf8b9e5633923dea4c0d403beb98144ca6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 - 3x)^{5} = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"21\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/9/7b96f2a2947535a9bcd698b4f0435d9b1484d895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\frac{4}{3} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{10}{3} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{5}{3} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"409\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/d/dedeac7e405e604431d2c5899221faf5232d6fc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)^{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"20\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is an odd number. Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e857a01eb3b80a16a8a4d5dc4185554630d6c92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 3x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f08b2610e5f14fa8091eecbcb3274573314cbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3x = -1 - 5 = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"162\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a9426960e07714e77f87a74268a137cfeaf9c1a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-6}{-3} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat\">1999 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" t